shell('components.html','Tokens and components',heading('DESIGN CONTRACT / HTML-3','A small, consistent toolkit.','The palette is an original approximation inspired by banknote colour families. It implies no official endorsement.')+f'''<section class="section"><h2>Colour tokens</h2><div class="swatches">{swatches}</div></section><section class="question-grid"><article class="paper-panel"><p class="eyebrow">DISPLAY / GEORGIA</p><h2 class="type-sample">Clarity has<br>character.</h2><p>Georgia serif headings, system sans-serif interface. No remote font dependency. Main text 16–18 px; labels at least 14 px.</p></article><article class="paper-panel"><p class="eyebrow">SPACE / SHAPE</p><h2>Room to read.</h2><p>8 px rhythm. 24–48 px sections. 16–24 px corners. 1 px ink outlines. Discovery permits offset edges; purchase and help use calm surfaces.</p><p>Desktop content up to 1200 px. Mobile gutters 20 px. Interactive controls at least 44 px high.</p></article></section><section class="paper-panel"><h2>Light and dark themes</h2><p>Use the theme toggle on any screen. Device preference supplies the initial theme; a choice persists on this device. Dark surface #1D1C20, panel #29272D, text #F7F4EC. Category accents retain dark ink. Print uses light colours.</p><h2>Actions and fields</h2><div class="actions">{a('health.html','Primary action')}{a('summary.html','Secondary action','button secondary')}<button disabled>Unavailable</button><button disabled aria-busy="true">Saving…</button></div><label for="component-input">Always-visible label</label><input id="component-input" placeholder="Example only"><p class="hint">Hint and error association sit next to the field.</p><details><summary>Keyboard and responsive contract</summary><p>Tab order follows the document. Focus has a visible outline; a skip link goes to main content. Native details, inputs and controls retain keyboard behaviour. Comparison tables use a labelled horizontal region on narrow screens; no critical terms are hidden in collapsed accordions. No decorative motion is required.</p></details></section>''','DS-001',[18,49],1,True)

